WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.915
C6.2 · Two signers by default

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.671
The preparer can neither approve nor sign; the approver cannot sign.

3
00:00:09.721 --> 00:00:14.057
Every signer has a limit. A tenant with a single user cannot pay.

4
00:00:15.207 --> 00:00:20.553
A change to anyone's payment rights takes effect only when a second admin confirms it.

